  - Python
abstract: |
  Pramana is a unified cosmological inference suite for performing Bayesian parameter estimation,
  model comparison, and forecasting in cosmology. It provides tools for likelihood evaluation,
  sampling, and post-processing tailored to cosmological datasets.

